      "name": "ReleaseVersionConfiguration",
      "description": {
        "content": "Manage the Visier product release versions for your tenants.\n<br>**Note:** <em>This API is available for Embedded Partners.</em>\n<br>**Note:** <em>This API is in **alpha**. While in alpha, APIs may change in a breaking way without notice; functionality may be removed, and no deprecation notices will be issued.\nIf you are interested in using this API, please contact your Customer Success Manager (CSM).</em>",
